diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8927.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8927.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #8574\n\nAdd a README to the benchmark directory documenting the commonly\nrecommended ways of running benchmarks:\n\n- **Go's built-in benchmarks** (`go test -bench`) with `benchstat` comparison\n  workflow for micro-benchmarks in the `primitives` directory\n- **benchmain** for end-to-end gRPC benchmarks with configurable workloads,\n  compression, network simulation, profiling, and result comparison via\n  `benchresult`\n- **run_bench.sh** for client/server QPS and latency testing with\n  parameter sweeps\n- **worker** binary for cross-language benchmark testing\n\nIncludes a complete flag reference table for `benchmain` and\n`run_bench.sh`, plus practical tips for getting reliable results.\n\nAlso adds a link to the benchmark README from `CONTRIBUTING.md` so that\nauthors and reviewers of performance-focused PRs can easily find the\nbenchmarking documentation.\n\nRELEASE NOTES: n/a","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8927/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8492","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8492/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8492/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8492/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8492","id":3295317968,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf886iUBO-","number":8492,"title":"chore: setup golangci-lint","user":{"login":"mmorel-35","id":6032561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMzI1NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi